"DawnStep University trains those who have declared for knighthood toward their first binding."
"Every declared candidate is admitted automatically."
"Rapport-born and outsider declared have separate housing and training times."
"Welcomers greet arrivals at a hub of teleport alcoves, with elevators opposite."
"Its halls hold cleansing rooms and ritual rooms, and it has a lab."
"The main sunset chamber juts from the campus's lower peak like a plate fungus on a trunk."
"A water curtain usually encloses the chamber, under a shallow golden dome on a pinkvein floor."
"The chamber holds hundreds and overlooks trees sheltering a scholar village far below."
"Declared candidates speak their oaths there at a ceremony; Stuart attended one."
